  "cause": {
    "corrective_workstream": "C6 successor recovery after native lock refresh and bounded Git runtime diagnosis",
    "kind": "terminal-campaign-with-verified-partial-publications",
    "summary": "The campaign publicly verified 39 independent immutable handoffs. Ruby failed before building because the reviewed native compatibility lock did not include the newly visible cyrus-sasl and ruby source projections. Git passed the coherent signed API freeze and native compatibility admission, then built successfully, but its Formula guest test git -C clone mergetool --tool-help exceeded the explicit 120000 ms runtime deadline before handoff publication. Git and Ruby produced no accepted handoff or release. A successor rebuilds only those two Formulae under the refreshed Kandelo lock and a fresh Kandelo-admitted rootfs generation without mutating this terminal campaign."
  },
